\begin{proofs}
	(i) Let $B\in {\cal G}$. Then $B$ is a quotient $d\to B$ of a subobject $d\mono f^{\ast}(A)$. But $A$ is a quotient $q:\coprod_{i\in I}c_{i}\to A$ of a coproduct of objects $c_{i}$ in $\cal C$, so, by considering the pullback
	\[
	\xymatrix{
		d' \ar[d] \ar[r] & f^{\ast}(\coprod_{i\in I}c_{i})\cong \coprod_{i\in I}f^{\ast}(c_i) \ar[d]^{q}  \\
